{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "35734242",
      "title": "Adding Automatic Logout",
      "sourceHash": "85dd77700cd34ca62ef49dcf99ca50c84b2e9893534c7ae769abbb622668d2c9",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 3.54,
          "en": "Now we're almost done",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.54,
          "end": 5.34,
          "en": "with adding authentication.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.34,
          "end": 8.1,
          "en": "I mean, it does work as it should after all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.1,
          "end": 10.533,
          "en": "But one last piece is missing here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.4,
          "end": 14.67,
          "en": "At the moment we always stay logged in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.67,
          "end": 16.92,
          "en": "if we got that token once.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.92,
          "end": 18.9,
          "en": "So as soon as we got the token, we save it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.9,
          "end": 22.38,
          "en": "and from that point on, we stay logged in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.38,
          "end": 25.35,
          "en": "Now, that's nice but unrealistic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.35,
          "end": 27.99,
          "en": "Indeed, the backend creates a token",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.99,
          "end": 31.44,
          "en": "that will actually expire after one hour.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.44,
          "end": 33.63,
          "en": "Now, that could be configured differently,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.63,
          "end": 35.31,
          "en": "but for security reasons,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.31,
          "end": 37.893,
          "en": "it's a relatively short lived token.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.82,
          "end": 40.44,
          "en": "Now, you could definitely create",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 40.44,
          "end": 43.23,
          "en": "more advanced authentication flows and setups",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.23,
          "end": 44.88,
          "en": "but here it is quite simple.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 44.88,
          "end": 47.88,
          "en": "And this token expires after one hour.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 47.88,
          "end": 51.69,
          "en": "Therefore, I also wanna log the user out after one hour",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 51.69,
          "end": 54.45,
          "en": "because the token is invalid thereafter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 54.45,
          "end": 56.46,
          "en": "And I don't just wanna log the user out,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 56.46,
          "end": 58.44,
          "en": "I also wanna clear the token",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 58.44,
          "end": 60.66,
          "en": "and I wanna remove it from local storage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 60.66,
          "end": 61.98,
          "en": "so after that one hour,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 61.98,
          "end": 64.53,
          "en": "the token should be removed from local storage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 64.53,
          "end": 66.57300000000001,
          "en": "and the UI should update accordingly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 67.68,
          "end": 69,
          "en": "Now, to enforce that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 69,
          "end": 71.01,
          "en": "we again got various options,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 71.01,
          "end": 73.11,
          "en": "and you can get creative here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 73.11,
          "end": 77.58,
          "en": "One option would be to go to the root layout.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 77.58,
          "end": 79.593,
          "en": "So to this Root.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 80.43,
          "end": 85.43,
          "en": "And in that file we could use the good old user fact hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 85.635,
          "end": 88.14,
          "en": "which is not a React navigation feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 88.14,
          "end": 90.96000000000001,
          "en": "but which we can of course still use here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 90.96000000000001,
          "end": 93.733,
          "en": "And then here, this useEffect hook could be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 93.733,
          "end": 97.74000000000001,
          "en": "to set a timer whenever the root layout is rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 97.74000000000001,
          "end": 100.25999999999999,
          "en": "which happens when the application starts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 100.25999999999999,
          "end": 102.87,
          "en": "because that is the very first component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 102.87,
          "end": 105.99000000000001,
          "en": "we definitely load for all our routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 105.99000000000001,
          "end": 107.25,
          "en": "If you have a different setup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 107.25,
          "end": 110.1,
          "en": "where you have multiple sibling root layouts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 110.1,
          "end": 111.78,
          "en": "this approach would not work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 111.78,
          "end": 114.47999999999999,
          "en": "But here, this is the one root component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 114.47999999999999,
          "end": 118.32,
          "en": "which definitely includes all other root components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 118.32,
          "end": 120.84,
          "en": "So therefore we can go to this root layout",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 120.84,
          "end": 124.23,
          "en": "and then set up our effect function here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 124.23,
          "end": 127.14,
          "en": "And my idea behind this effect function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 127.14,
          "end": 130.56,
          "en": "is that I wanna get my token here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 130.56,
          "end": 132.18,
          "en": "And since I'm in the root layout,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 132.18,
          "end": 133.68,
          "en": "and I'm getting the token here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 133.68,
          "end": 135.39,
          "en": "with help of the token loader,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 135.39,
          "end": 138.84,
          "en": "I can simply use useLoaderData here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 138.84,
          "end": 141.07,
          "en": "I don't even need to use useRouteLoaderData",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 142.56,
          "end": 144.39,
          "en": "and use the idea of the route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 144.39,
          "end": 147.54,
          "en": "because here I already am in that very component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 147.54,
          "end": 150.06,
          "en": "that's rendered for the root route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 150.06,
          "end": 152.34,
          "en": "And then here I got that token.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 152.34,
          "end": 154.74,
          "en": "And that token can now be set as a dependency",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 154.74,
          "end": 155.82,
          "en": "for a useEffect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 155.82,
          "end": 157.56,
          "en": "so that this effect function runs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 157.56,
          "end": 159.84,
          "en": "whenever the token changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 159.84,
          "end": 161.22,
          "en": "And here I simply wanna check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 161.22,
          "end": 162.96,
          "en": "if we maybe don't have a token.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 162.96,
          "end": 165.06,
          "en": "If that's the case, I just wanna return",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 165.06,
          "end": 166.68,
          "en": "because there's nothing to do then.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 166.68,
          "end": 168.87,
          "en": "If we don't have a token anymore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 168.87,
          "end": 170.85,
          "en": "if this effect function was executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 170.85,
          "end": 173.31,
          "en": "because the token was removed, for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 173.31,
          "end": 176.13,
          "en": "then we don't have anything to do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 176.13,
          "end": 177.72,
          "en": "But if we do have a token,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 177.72,
          "end": 180.03,
          "en": "I wanna set a timer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 180.03,
          "end": 183.48,
          "en": "I wanna set a timer that expires after one hour",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 183.48,
          "end": 186.72,
          "en": "and that then triggers that logout action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 186.72,
          "end": 188.76,
          "en": "So that basically sends a request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 188.76,
          "end": 191.073,
          "en": "to that logout route we added earlier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 192.18,
          "end": 194.49,
          "en": "For that, we can use a navbar hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 194.49,
          "end": 196.29,
          "en": "provided by React Router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 196.29,
          "end": 198.21,
          "en": "That's the use submit hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 198.21,
          "end": 200.163,
          "en": "which gives us a submit function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 201.48,
          "end": 202.86,
          "en": "And we learned about this hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 202.86,
          "end": 204.72,
          "en": "in the routing section, of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 204.72,
          "end": 208.44,
          "en": "which we can use to programmatically submit a form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 208.44,
          "end": 212.37,
          "en": "And here I wanna basically submit that logout form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 212.37,
          "end": 215.13,
          "en": "which I have in my main navigation file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 215.13,
          "end": 217.05,
          "en": "I wanna send that logout request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 217.05,
          "end": 218.2,
          "en": "That's what I wanna do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 219.12,
          "end": 221.52,
          "en": "We can do this with help of this submit function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 221.52,
          "end": 223.44,
          "en": "which we also set as a dependency here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 223.44,
          "end": 224.79,
          "en": "on this effect function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 224.79,
          "end": 226.95,
          "en": "because we're going to use it in the effect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 226.95,
          "end": 229.983,
          "en": "And once that timer expired, I will call submit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 231.06,
          "end": 234.72,
          "en": "I won't pass any data because there is no data to submit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 234.72,
          "end": 237.99,
          "en": "But I will target this /Logout action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 237.99,
          "end": 239.37,
          "en": "this logout route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 239.37,
          "end": 241.68,
          "en": "the action that belongs to that route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 241.68,
          "end": 243.693,
          "en": "set the method to post.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 245.01,
          "end": 247.56,
          "en": "And that will therefore trigger that logout route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 247.56,
          "end": 250.14,
          "en": "and well, start that logout process",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 250.14,
          "end": 252.69,
          "en": "where we clear the token.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 252.69,
          "end": 257.16,
          "en": "Now here I will set the timeout to one hour",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 257.16,
          "end": 259.26,
          "en": "by multiplying one with 60,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 259.26,
          "end": 262.11,
          "en": "so 60 minutes, then 60 seconds",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 262.11,
          "end": 263.7,
          "en": "and then 1000 milliseconds",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 263.7,
          "end": 267.15,
          "en": "because set timeout expects to get the duration",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 267.15,
          "end": 268.89,
          "en": "in milliseconds here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 268.89,
          "end": 271.11,
          "en": "So that's one hour in milliseconds,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 271.11,
          "end": 272.40999999999997,
          "en": "what I'm calculating here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 273.36,
          "end": 275.22,
          "en": "And with that we get this effect function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 275.22,
          "end": 278.04,
          "en": "which executes whenever the root layout component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 278.04,
          "end": 280.38,
          "en": "is rendered or when the token",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 280.38,
          "end": 282.24,
          "en": "or the submit function changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 282.24,
          "end": 284.52,
          "en": "The submit function won't change though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 284.52,
          "end": 286.23,
          "en": "but the token might change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 286.23,
          "end": 289.40999999999997,
          "en": "And if we have a token, then we start that timer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 289.40999999999997,
          "end": 291.9,
          "en": "which clears the token after one hour.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 291.9,
          "end": 293.373,
          "en": "that's what we're doing here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 294.39,
          "end": 295.223,
          "en": "We can, by the way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 295.223,
          "end": 297.51,
          "en": "also remove the use navigation import here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 297.51,
          "end": 298.90999999999997,
          "en": "which we don't need anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 300.09,
          "end": 302.85,
          "en": "So now we would clear the token after one hour.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 302.85,
          "end": 306.42,
          "en": "But this solution still isn't perfect yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 306.42,
          "end": 308.193,
          "en": "It still has a flaw.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}